% formalizes: claim:ethics-p4
% claim: Prop. IV: distinct things are distinguished by their substances' attributes or by their modifications
% says: Two or more distinct things are distinguished one from the other, either by the difference of the attributes of the substances, or by the difference of their modifications.
% "Distinguished either by attributes or by modifications": read as a
% constraint, since Datalog derives no disjunction. distinct(X, Y): X and Y
% are two things, not one.
bottom :- distinct(X, Y), not distinguished_by_attribute(X, Y), not distinguished_by_mode(X, Y).
